WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
One of the last things I did live

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.233
was a show hear at Largo.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.904
With, like, Sandler and Apatow, and...

00:00:06.904 --> 00:00:08.023
[Lauren] Oh wow.

00:00:08.023 --> 00:00:10.030
And it was so much fun, and I think

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.550
a couple of days later...

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.870
everything shutdown.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:14.830
It's crazy.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:15.663
Yeah.

00:00:15.663 --> 00:00:17.159
Literally the day things
were shutting down

00:00:17.159 --> 00:00:18.780
I did Who Wants to Be a Millionaire .

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.400
I got to like be a contestant.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.850
And it was the most
exciting day of my life,

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.500
and then we like went back home and

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.990
everything was shutdown,
we couldn't tell anyone.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:28.730
It was like the weirdest
most dystopic feeling.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.870
Has it aired?

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:30.991
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:30.991 --> 00:00:32.300
Did you win anything?

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.413
I won 500,000 dollars for charity.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.340
Charity?

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.810
Yeah.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:38.873
Oh. I would love if...

00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:40.550
Well did you wanna know the question?

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:43.359
That I, I actually wanted
to quiz you on this.

00:00:43.359 --> 00:00:44.192
Uh oh.

00:00:44.192 --> 00:00:45.920
Because, I thought you would
know the answer to this.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.010
I may not, but go ahead.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.750
Okay, this was the question I had to get

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.910
to get the 500,000 dollars,
and I had to call my dad

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.710
as my lifeline and he helped me.

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:54.833
But, Okay,

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.450
six U.S. presidents share
the same first name,

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.330
John, James,

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.560
George, William.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.423
Which, there are six
that have that one name.

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:10.680
Uh, it's not William.
Can I hear em' again?

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.573
John, James, George, William.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.590
Wow. George Washington, George Bush,

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.070
man that's a really good question.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.640
It's really hard, and I
don't know anything about

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.340
presidents so I was like totally screwed.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.060
Yeah I do, I just know that
there's a lot of George's,

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.726
and then there's James
Madison, James Polk,

00:01:29.726 --> 00:01:30.893
James uhhh....

00:01:31.819 --> 00:01:33.200
Man!

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.710
Now you're just one ago.

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:37.840
No, I want you to guess it.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.351
Okay, can I write these down? George,

00:01:39.351 --> 00:01:40.628
Yeah.

00:01:40.628 --> 00:01:43.700
I'm eliminating William.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.262
George, and I think I'm
wise to do that, hello?

00:01:46.262 --> 00:01:47.800
You're correct, you're correct.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.620
George, James, and what's the other one?

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.293
Um, George, James, John.

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:55.286
John Adams, John F. Kennedy...

00:01:55.286 --> 00:01:57.550
(whispers) I'm gonna say it's not.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.830
There's James Garfield.
There's a lot of James,

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:04.390
there's James Polk, there's...

00:02:05.233 --> 00:02:06.066
(sucks teeth)

00:02:06.066 --> 00:02:07.020
Do you wanna hint?

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:07.940
Yeah.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.140
There's like a nickname associated

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:12.710
with one of the names that also makes....

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:15.035
Like there are more presidencies
use a nick name as well.

00:02:15.035 --> 00:02:15.868
Well,

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:19.790
yeah cause, I think it's gonna be James.

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:22.774
Because... I just think it has to be James

00:02:22.774 --> 00:02:24.842
because it can be Jimmy,
it could be James,

00:02:24.842 --> 00:02:25.675
it could be Jim.

00:02:25.675 --> 00:02:26.508
Yeah, so that's what I would...

00:02:26.508 --> 00:02:28.110
Yes, that's correct.

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.370
But, it was so tense.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.700
My dad, I called my dad and he said John,

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.470
and then we were just sitting
there for like ten seconds

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:35.090
and I was like, are you sure?

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.640
And then he was like, James, James, James!

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:38.690
And like it hung up on him,

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:40.110
and then I had to sit
there for ten minutes

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.400
and weigh whether or not I trust my dad.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.010
Like, it was just like crazy.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.180
You know what, I wish, I
wish I had been on that show.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.180
And I wish I had answered that correctly.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.840
I think I would have
answered that correctly,

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:50.893
and then,

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:56.320
I wish that I had won, and
I'd been really excited.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.870
And then I wish that on
camera they had reminded me

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:00.305
that the money goes to charity.

00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:01.138
(laughter)

00:03:01.138 --> 00:03:03.494
And I wish everyone could
have seen my face fall.

00:03:03.494 --> 00:03:05.340
(laughter)

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.820
And then me start to kinda ask like...

00:03:09.078 --> 00:03:11.173
(stutters) yes, I imagine
some goes to charity.

00:03:11.173 --> 00:03:12.006
And they're like, it goes to charity.

00:03:12.006 --> 00:03:14.230
(laughter)

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:16.610
And then, see me getting into it with the

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.607
executive producers as
the credits come down.

00:03:18.607 --> 00:03:20.857
(laughter)

